# SELECTION OBJECTIVE

Do NOT select the winner using raw accuracy.

Primary model-selection objective should reward:

1. calibrated probabilities;
2. incremental information over B3;
3. stability through time;
4. breadth across symbols;
5. useful selective-prediction coverage;
6. economically meaningful separation between predicted winners and losers.

Create a clear frozen selection rule before comparing candidate models.

